Subject: [PATCH 12/16] virtio_net: enable VQs early
Date: Sun, 5 Oct 2014 19:07:24 +0300
Message-ID: <1412525038-15871-13-git-send-email-mst@redhat.com>
References: <1412525038-15871-1-git-send-email-mst@redhat.com>
Mime-Version: 1.0
